          <Pad Id="m3hhwYE4JnNKqhv6k95FGa" Comment="Title" Bounds="182,990,190,19" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="HowTo Build a Path">
            <p:TypeAnnotation LastCategoryFullName="Primitive" LastDependency="CoreLibBasics.vl">
              <Choice Kind="TypeFlag" Name="String" />
            </p:TypeAnnotation>
          </Pad>
          <Pad Id="bZRCU7j50r2E1jNodLvcbK" Bounds="85,1069,830,305" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="Notes:&#xD;&#xA;- Every node takes the path so far at Input (unconnected = the empty path, so the first node starts a new path) and returns the longer path at Output. A path never changes: a node returns a new path when one of its inputs changes, so one path can feed several Path nodes.&#xD;&#xA;- Points are in units of the Renderer Space (1 unit = 100 DIP, origin top left), angles in cycles (1 = full turn), like Skia.&#xD;&#xA;- LineTo (Relative) counts from the last point: the offset 1.2, 0 leads from 0.5, 0.8 to 1.7, 0.8. Close joins the end of the contour with its start.&#xD;&#xA;- ArcTo (tangent) rounds the corner between the last point, Corner and Destination Point. ArcTo (SVG) is the SVG arc command: Radius, X Axis Rotate, Large Arc, Sweep, Destination Point. The oval form takes Bounds, Start Angle, Sweep Angle and Force Move To.&#xD;&#xA;- Add... nodes start a new contour. An unconnected Input starts a new path, so AddRoundRect alone is enough in column 3.&#xD;&#xA;- Column 4 shows the quadratic and relative forms: QuadTo and QuadTo (Relative) bend with one Control Point, MoveTo (Relative) starts a second contour, CubicTo (Relative) and ArcTo (Relative) count their points from the last one. Column 5 adds whole contours: AddOval and AddArc (Bounds, Start Angle, Sweep Angle), AddPoly (Points, Closed) and AddPath, which appends the path at Other.&#xD;&#xA;- Skia: the nodes of Graphics.Skia.Paths.&#xD;&#xA;- Connect the Path node to Renderer [Qt] or a Group [Qt].">
            <p:TypeAnnotation LastCategoryFullName="Primitive" LastDependency="CoreLibBasics.vl">
              <Choice Kind="TypeFlag" Name="String" />
            </p:TypeAnnotation>
            <p:ValueBoxSettings>
              <p:fontsize p:Type="Int32">9</p:fontsize>
              <p:stringtype p:Assembly="VL.Core" p:Type="VL.Core.StringType">Comment</p:stringtype>
            </p:ValueBoxSettings>
          </Pad>
          <Pad Id="ECcNQf2suOoOOsgAwpIYiI" Bounds="1300,261,290,59" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="4  Quadratic and relative segments: QuadTo, QuadTo (Relative), MoveTo (Relative), CubicTo (Relative) and ArcTo (Relative) count from the last point.">
            <p:TypeAnnotation LastCategoryFullName="Primitive" LastDependency="CoreLibBasics.vl">
              <Choice Kind="TypeFlag" Name="String" />
            </p:TypeAnnotation>
            <p:ValueBoxSettings>
              <p:fontsize p:Type="Int32">9</p:fontsize>
              <p:stringtype p:Assembly="VL.Core" p:Type="VL.Core.StringType">Comment</p:stringtype>
            </p:ValueBoxSettings>
          </Pad>
